    console.error('Error posting message:', error.message);
  });
```

This function uses Axios library for making HTTP requests. Make sure you have it installed by running `npm install axios` or `yarn add axios` in your project.

The `postMessageToSlack` function accepts two arguments - the text you want to post and the Slack channel identifier (including the channel prefix like '#general'). It returns a Promise that resolves with the response data from the Slack API once the message has been successfully posted.

